Package: rut360gw-runtime
Version: @VERSION@
Depends: libc
Source: https://github.com/yasserboutaleb/rutos-gsm-sip-gateway
License: GPL-2.0-only
Section: net
Architecture: mips_24kc
Maintainer: yasserboutaleb <https://github.com/yasserboutaleb/rutos-gsm-sip-gateway/issues>
Description: Reduced Asterisk 18 runtime for rut360gw, embedded in flash (~1.8 MB).
 Archive verified (sha256) then extracted to RAM when the gateway starts, without network.
 Asterisk 18.15.1 and pjproject 2.12.1 rebuilt without OpenSSL (OpenWrt 21.02 recipes),
 official OpenWrt 21.02 dependencies, stub libxml2, ALSA and termcap (functions
 imported but never called). Built by build/runtime in the source repository.
